' The start screen again, in a new process: take up the save. The rules and
' the difficulty come out of the file, not from the screen — nothing here says
' "extended" and the game is extended all the same.
menuclick 160,100        ' the intro: a click goes to the start screen (IntroScene.cs:135-139)
menuclick 163,27         ' LOAD
day                      ' a day in the game that was taken up
save
